    year: "2010",
    publisher: "Snow Lion / Shambhala Publications (Dist. Penguin Random House)",
    category: "Master Biography",
    categoryGroup: "academic",
    desc: "The definitive biographical and doctrinal study of Kunchen Dolpopa, detailing the historical origins of the Shentong system and the Great Kumbum of Jomonang.",
