    categoryGroup: "treatise",
    desc: "Exploration of the Second Drukchen Rinpoche’s teachings affirming the non-dual luminous nature of awareness.",
    link: "https://search.worldcat.org/search?q=Juggernaut+of+the+Non-Dual+View+Tony+Duff",
    sourceName: "WorldCat Catalog",
  },
  {
    title: "The Sutra of Queen Śrīmālā of the Lion's Roar (Śrīmālādevī Siṃhanāda Sūtra)",
